  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "在新照片里，模型只画了狗的框。要判断椅子是否被漏掉，下一步该做什么？",
      "en": "Only the dog has a box in the new photo. How can you check whether the model missed the chair?"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "zh": "查看原图，看有没有被遮住的椅子",
        "en": "Look for a partly hidden chair in the original photo"
      },
      {
        "zh": "只数检测框的数量",
        "en": "Only count the detection boxes"
      },
      {
        "zh": "把狗的框改名为椅子",
        "en": "Rename the dog's box to chair"
      }
    ],
    "correct": 0,
    "feedback": {
      "zh": "用原图核对预测。看到了椅子但没有它的框，才知道出现了漏检。",
      "en": "Check predictions against the photo. Seeing a chair without a box tells you it was missed."
